       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TCRITEMS.
       AUTHOR.              BARBARA J. PLUM.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        MAR.30, 1982.
      *REMARKS.             THIS PROGRAM WILL PRINT A REPORT, SORTED BY
      *                     CORPORATE CODE. IT WILL LIST ALL CORPORATE
      *                     CODES BELOW EXPEDITE WITH AND DESPITE OPEN
      *                     PURCHASE ORDERS, IF THEY CONTAIN THE LETTER
      *                     "C" (FOR CRITICAL) IN THE STR-INS-ITM FIELD.
      *
      *                     ALL QUANTITIES ON THE DOCK ARE TREATED AS
      *                     IF ONHAND, BEFORE THE DETERMINATION IS MADE.
      *
      *                     1) ON JUNE 10, 1982 THIS PROGRAM WAS CHANGED
      *                     SO THAT ALL CRITICAL ITEMS (ITEMS THAT CONTAIN
      *                     EITHER THE LETTER "C" OR "B" IN THE STR-INS-ITM
      *                     FIELD) ARE LISTED. THEY NO LONGER NEED TO BE
      *                     BELOW EXPEDITE. THE REPORT IS SORTED BY CORPOR-
      *                     ATE CODE.   BJP.
      *
      *                     2) ON MARCH 15, 1983 THIS PROGRAM WAS CHANGED
      *                     SO THAT THE ONLY REQUIREMENT FOR A CODE TO
      *                     APPEAR ON THIS REPORT IS THAT THE STR-INS-ITM
      *                     FIELD CONTAINS THE LETTER "C" OR "B". BEFORE
      *                     THE CHANGE, WE EXCLUDED STOCKOUT CODES AND ALSO
      *                     CODES THAT HAD BOTH REORDER AND EXPEDITE
      *                     LEVELS VALUED AT ZERO.
      *
      *                     2) ON MARCH 22, 1983 THIS PROGRAM WAS CHANGED
      *                     SO THAT ONORDER ERRORS IN THE DATA BASE WOULD
      *                     NOT ELIMINATE CODES FROM APPEARING ON THIS
      *                     REPORT. THE PROGRAM ASSUMED THAT THERE HAD TO
      *                     BE OPEN PURCHASE ORDERS IF ONORDER WAS GREATER
      *                     THAN ZERO.
      *
      *               ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROUTINE "TDATECHK" ON
      *               MAY 22, 1985.    V.W.D.
      *
      *               DECEMBER 9, 1986 - EXPANDED ALL PRICE/COST FIELD
      *               SIZES.  ALSO ADDED COPYLIB FOR ALL DATABASE BUFFER
      *               AREAS AND ADDED CALLS TO "CDESC" TO PROVIDE CODE
      *               DESCRIPTIONS.      D.A. PLUM.
      *
      *              MARCH 12, 1987.  THE FOLLOWING WAS ADDED:
      *               -TRSCREEN FOR FRONT END REPORT OPTIONS
      *               -THDPRT2 FOR THE HEADER PAGE
      *               -PRINT COMPRESSION FEATURE
      *               -NON-HP LOGIC
      *               -SONORDER FOR TOTAL ONORDER
      *                                   C.R. KALMAN.
      *
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  SEPT 16, 1996   CA YODER
      *C   MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  07/29/1997   CA YODER     REQ #95-015
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM TO ACCEPT AND USE THE NEW OPTIONS ADDED
      *C    TO THE MATERIALS CONTROL REPORTS.
      *C    NOTE:  THIS PROGRAM NOW USES COPYLIB MEMBERS FOR MOST OF
      *C           ITS PROCESSING LOGIC.  TO SEE ALL OF THE MEMBERS,
      *C           LOOK IN COPYLIB FOR THE FILES THAT START WITH THE
      *C           PREFIX "MTLS".
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           C01 IS NEWPAGE.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT SORT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
           SELECT USAGEFIL-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSAG
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DDESC-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DPORECD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DPOITEM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1001
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DVENDOR-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DMANPART-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3603
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

