      *01  DATA-LINE                   PIC X(112).
      *PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA, DATA-LINE.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       START-UP SECTION.

       BEGIN-SORT.
9406CK     MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
9406CK     CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING SCOPE.

           ACCEPT HD-ROUTE-DATA.
           ACCEPT MTLS-DATA-LINE-1.
           ACCEPT MTLS-DATA-LINE-1B.
           ACCEPT MTLS-DATA-LINE-2.

      *---------- OPEN THE PRINT FILE, GET THE FILE NUMBER OF THE PRINT
      *---------- FILE, AND PRINT THE HEADER PAGE.
           MOVE HD-SPOOLER-NUMBER TO OVRPRTF-TOFILE-NUM.
           MOVE "*YES"            TO OVRPRTF-SHARED.
           MOVE HD-NO-OF-COPIES   TO OVRPRTF-COPIES.
           MOVE "MCPRT"           TO OVRPRTF-FILE.
           PERFORM 996-OVERRIDE-PRINT-FILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-PRT.

           MOVE "TCRITEMS" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN INPUT MSTORERM-I, MPLTINFO-I, DDESC-I, DPORECD-I,
                DPOITEM-I, DVENDOR-I, DMANPART-I.

           MOVE "P 01" TO PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "DBGET ERR: BEGIN-SORT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "PLT-ARG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE PLT-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE MTLS-RPT-TITLE     TO PRT-RPT-TITLE.
           MOVE "TCRITEMS"         TO PRT-PGM-NAME.
           IF MTLS-FROM-RANGE > SPACES OR MTLS-TO-RANGE > SPACES
               PERFORM 9-MOVE-HEADING-DESC.

           COPY MTLSPROC IN COPYLIB.

      *    SORT SORT-FILE
      *         ON ASCENDING KEY      SORT-CODE
      *                               SORT-PO-NO
      *         INPUT  PROCEDURE IS  7-INPUT
      *         OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS  8-OUTPUT.

           GOBACK.

       2-BLOWUP.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM NORMAL-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0.

           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                                VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS,
                                BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

      *******************************************
      *                                         *
      *    I N P U T    P R O C E D U R E       *
      *                                         *
      *******************************************

       7-INPUT-RECORDS SECTION.

       COPY MTLSINPT IN COPYLIB.

      *7-INPUT SECTION.
      *    PERFORM 7-1-HSK.
      *    PERFORM 7-6-MAIN THRU 7-6-MAIN-EXIT UNTIL EOF-SW = "Y".
      *    GO TO 7-INPUT-EXIT.
      *
      *7-1-HSK.
      *    MOVE "TCRITEMS" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
      *    OPEN INPUT MSTORERM-I, MPLTINFO-I, DDESC-I, DPORECD-I,
      *         DPOITEM-I, DVENDOR-I, DMANPART-I.
      *
      *    READ MSTORERM-I FIRST RECORD INTO BUF-MSTORERM
      *        AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *        MOVE "Y" TO EOF-SW.
      *
      *7-6-MAIN.
      *****************************************************
      *                                                   *
      *    IF STR-INS-ITM IS NOT = "C"OR "B", IT          *
      *      SHOULD NOT APPEAR ON THIS REPORT.            *
      *                                                   *
      *****************************************************
      *
      *    IF (STR-INS-ITM = "C" OR "B")
      *      AND (CORP-CODE NOT = "NON-STR")
      *        ADD 1 TO REL-SORT-K
      *    ELSE
      *        GO TO 7-6-CONT.
      *
      *    MOVE "P 01" TO PLT-ARG.
      *    MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
      *    READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
      *        INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *       MOVE "DBGET ERR: 7-6-MAIN" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *       MOVE "PLT-ARG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
      *       MOVE PLT-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
      *       PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
      *    CALL "SONORDER" USING BASE, CORP-CODE, SONORDER-PARMS,
      *                    MPLTINFO-COMPANY, STATUS-AREA, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
      *                    BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
      *    IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG NOT = SPACES
      *       PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
      *    IF SONORDER-TOTAL-ONORDER NOT = 0
      *        PERFORM 7-62-FIND-VEND-CODE THRU 7-62-FVC-X
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE SPACES TO SORT-RCD
      *        MOVE CORP-CODE TO SORT-CODE
      *        RELEASE SORT-RCD.
      *
      * 7-6-CONT.
      *** SERIAL GET THRU MSTORERM FOR CODES ***
      *    READ MSTORERM-I NEXT INTO BUF-MSTORERM
      *        AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *        IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
      *            MOVE "Y" TO EOF-SW
      *            GO TO 7-6-MAIN-EXIT
      *        ELSE
      *            MOVE "DBGET ERR: 7-6-MAIN" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *            PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
      *7-6-MAIN-EXIT.
      *    EXIT.

      *******************************************
      *   HERE THE VENDOR CODE IS FOUND, SO     *
      *   THAT THE PROGRAM CAN BE SORTED BY     *
      *   VENDOR CODE.                          *
      *******************************************
      *
      *7-62-FIND-VEND-CODE.
      *    MOVE CORP-CODE TO CORPCDE OF DPOITEM-REC-I.
      *    START DPOITEM-I KEY = CORPCDE OF DPOITEM-REC-I
      *        INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *        IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *           MOVE SPACES    TO SORT-RCD
      *           MOVE CORP-CODE TO SORT-CODE
      *           MOVE "Y" TO SORT-ONORDER-ERROR
      *           RELEASE SORT-RCD
      *           MOVE SPACES TO SORT-ONORDER-ERROR
      *           GO TO 7-62-FVC-X
      *        ELSE
      *       MOVE "DBFIND ERR: 7-62-FIND-VEND-CODE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *       PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
      *
      *7-621-FVC-CONT.
      *    READ DPOITEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM
      *        AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *        IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
      *           GO TO 7-62-FVC-X
      *        ELSE
      *           MOVE "DBGET ERR: 7-621-FVC-CONT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *           PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
      *    IF CORPCDE OF DPOITEM-REC-I NOT = CORP-CODE
      *        GO TO 7-62-FVC-X.
      *
      *    MOVE ITM-PO-RCV-NO TO PO-RLSE-RS.
      *
      *    IF ITM-QTY-DLVR < ITM-QTY-ORD
      *        MOVE SPACES       TO SORT-RCD
      *        MOVE ITM-QTY-DLVR TO SORT-ITM-DLVR
      *        MOVE ITM-QTY-ORD  TO SORT-ITM-ORD
      *        MOVE ITM-UM       TO SORT-UM
      *        MOVE ITM-NUMBER   TO SORT-ITM-NO
      *        MOVE WS-PO        TO SORT-PO
      *        IF WS-RLSE = ZEROES
      *            MOVE SPACES TO SORT-PO-REM
      *        ELSE
      *            MOVE "-" TO SORT-DASH
      *            MOVE WS-RLSE TO SORT-RLSE
      *    ELSE
      *        GO TO 7-621-FVC-CONT.
      *
      *7-622-FVC-CONT.
      *    MOVE PO-RLSE-RS TO PO-ARG.
      *    MOVE PO-ARG     TO PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC-I.
      *    READ DPORECD-I INTO BUF-DPORECD
      *        INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *        GO TO 7-621-FVC-CONT
      *    ELSE
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *       MOVE "DBFIND ERR: 7-622-FVC-CONT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *       PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
      *
      *
      *    MOVE PO-VEN-CODE       TO  SORT-VEND-CODE.
      *
      *    IF PO-DATE-CN > SPACES
      *        MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
      *        MOVE PO-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
      *        CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
      *        MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO SORT-PO-DATE
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE SPACES        TO  SORT-PO-DATE.
      *
      *    IF PO-SHIP-DATE-CN > SPACES
      *        IF PO-SHIP-DATE-CN IS NOT NUMERIC
      *            MOVE PO-SHIP-DATE TO SORT-SHIP-DATE
      *        ELSE
      *        MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
      *        MOVE PO-SHIP-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
      *        CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
      *        MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO SORT-SHIP-DATE
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE SPACES         TO  SORT-SHIP-DATE.
      *
      *    IF PO-EXPECT-DATE-CN > SPACES
      *        MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
      *        MOVE PO-EXPECT-DATE  TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
      *        CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
      *        MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT  TO SORT-EXP-DATE
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE SPACES          TO  SORT-EXP-DATE.
      *
      *    MOVE CORP-CODE          TO  SORT-CODE.
      *    RELEASE SORT-RCD.
      *    GO TO 7-621-FVC-CONT.
      *
      *7-62-FVC-X.
      *    EXIT.

       7-IR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *******************************************
      *                                         *
      *    O U T P U T   P R O C E D U R E      *
      *                                         *
      *******************************************

      *8-OUTPUT SECTION.
       8-WRITE-RECORDS SECTION.
           PERFORM 8-1-HSK.
           PERFORM 8-6-MAIN UNTIL EOSF-SW = "Y".
      *------- DON'T PRINT TOTAL LINE IF BIN LOC OR MANUF SORT BECAUSE
      *------- CODES COULD BE DUPLICATED.
           IF MTLS-SORT-OPT NOT = "06" AND MTLS-SORT-OPT NOT = "08"
               MOVE CODES-RELEASED TO PRT-GRD-ITMS
               MOVE GRAND-TOTAL TO PRT-GRD-TOTAL
               WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM GRAND-TOTAL-LINE
                   AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           PERFORM 8-2-EOJ.
           GO TO 8-WR-EXIT.

       8-1-HSK.

           OPEN INPUT USAGEFIL-I.
           CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
           MOVE CHAR-1636PI TO COMPRESS-PRINT.
           MOVE CHAR-10PI TO NORMAL-PRINT.
           MOVE "DHDR48.PUB" TO HD-FILE-NAME.
           CALL "THDPRT2" USING HD-RET-CODE, HD-FILE-NAME, FNUM,
                                HD-ROUTE-DATA, ESC-NAME.
           IF HD-RET-CODE NOT = 0
              MOVE "THDPRT ERR: 8-1-HSK" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "HD-RET-CODE = " TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE HD-RET-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              MOVE "DHDR48.PUB" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
           IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM COMPRESS-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0.

           PERFORM 9-MOVE-OPTION-LINES.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-1  AFTER ADVANCING 3 LINES.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-2  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-2B AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-2C AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-3  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-4  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-5  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-6  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-7  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM OPTION-LINE-8  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.

           PERFORM 8-3-RETURN THRU 8-3-RETURN-EXIT.

           IF EOSF-SW = "Y"
               MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-RCD
               WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING NEWPAGE
               MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE
               CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
               MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO PRT-DATE
               MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO PRT-TIME
               MOVE 1  TO  PRT-PAGE
               WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM HEADING-1 BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINE
               WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM HEADING-2 BEFORE ADVANCING 2 LINES
               MOVE "ZERO CODES QUALIFIED FOR REPORT" TO PRINT-LINE
               WRITE PRINT-RCD AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES
               PERFORM 8-2-EOJ
               GO TO 8-WR-EXIT.

           PERFORM 9-MOVE-CONTROL-BREAK.

      *    MOVE SORT-CODE TO SAVE-CC.
           ADD 1 TO RET-SORT-K.
           MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-RCD.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING NEWPAGE.
      *    PERFORM 8-10-HDR-INFO THRU 8-10-HDR-INFO-EXIT.
      *    PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS THRU 8-15-HEADINGS-X.
           PERFORM HDR-1-INFO THRU HDR-1-INFO-EXIT.
           PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS THRU 8-15-HEADINGS1-6-X.

       8-10-HDR-INFO.

       HDR-1-INFO.
           ADD 1                       TO   PG-CTR.
           MOVE PG-CTR                 TO   PRT-PAGE.
           MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO PRT-DATE.
           MOVE DATE-FORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO PRT-TIME.

       HDR-1-INFO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       HDR-8-9-INFO.

           MOVE  4  TO CDESC-LINES-TO-GET.
           MOVE "N" TO CDESC-LOCAL-DESC-OPTION.

           CALL "CDESC" USING CDESC-RET-CODE,
                              BASE,
                              STATUS-AREA,
                              BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                              SRT-CORP-CODE,
                              CDESC-DATA.

           IF CDESC-RET-CODE IS NOT EQUAL TO "00"
               MOVE "NO DESCRIPTION ON FILE" TO PRT-DESC1
               GO TO HDR-10-13-INFO.

           MOVE CDESC (1) TO PRT-DESC1.
           MOVE CDESC (2) TO PRT-DESC2.
           MOVE CDESC (3) TO PRT-DESC3.
           MOVE CDESC (4) TO PRT-DESC4.

       HDR-8-9-INFO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       HDR-10-13-INFO.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-I.
           READ MSTORERM-I INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               GO TO 8-10-HDR-INFO-EXIT
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "DBGET ERR: HDR-10-13-INFO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           IF STR-ACT-DATE-CN > SPACES
               MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
               MOVE STR-ACT-DATE         TO  DATE-VALIDATE-IN
               CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
               MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO PRT-ACT-D
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES               TO  PRT-ACT-D.

           IF STR-LAST-IDATE-CN > SPACES
               MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
               MOVE STR-LAST-IDATE       TO  DATE-VALIDATE-IN
               CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
               MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO PRT-ISS-D
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES               TO  PRT-ACT-D.

           MOVE STR-REORDER              TO  PRT-REORD.
           MOVE STR-MAX                  TO  PRT-MAX.
           MOVE STR-EXPEDITE             TO  PRT-EXPED.
           MOVE STR-AVG-COST             TO  PRT-AVG.
           MOVE STR-UM                   TO  PRT-UM.
           MOVE STR-MKT-COST             TO  PRT-MKT.
           MOVE STR-ONHAND               TO  PRT-ONHAND.
           MOVE STR-MTH-FCST             TO  PRT-FCST.
           MOVE STR-LAST-CHARGE          TO  PRT-CHG.
           MOVE STR-RESERVED             TO  PRT-RSRV.
           MOVE STR-EST-LT               TO  PRT-EST-LT.
           COMPUTE TOTAL-COST = SRT-ONHAND * SRT-COST.
           ADD TOTAL-COST TO GRAND-TOTAL.

           COMPUTE AVAILABLE = (STR-ONHAND - STR-RESERVED).
           MOVE AVAILABLE                TO  PRT-AVAIL.
           MOVE STR-LAST-DLVTIMES (1)    TO  PRT-DEL-LT.
      *
      *    IF SORT-ONORDER-ERROR = "Y"
      *        MOVE ZEROS                TO  PRT-ONORD
      *    ELSE

           CALL "SONORDER" USING BASE, SRT-CORP-CODE, SONORDER-PARMS,
                                 MPLTINFO-COMPANY, STATUS-AREA,
                                 BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
           IF BU-DISPLAY-MSG NOT = SPACES
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
           ELSE
              MOVE SONORDER-TOTAL-ONORDER   TO  PRT-ONORD.

      *************************************************
      *                                               *
      * C L A S S I F I C A T I O N    OF   I T E M S *
      *                                               *
      *************************************************

           MOVE SPACES TO PRT-STATUS-AREA.
           MOVE ZERO   TO STAT-SUB.

           IF STR-HIGH-USAGE IS GREATER THAN SPACES
               ADD       1         TO STAT-SUB
               MOVE     "HU"       TO PRT-STAT (STAT-SUB).

           IF STR-WR-DOWN     = "X"
               ADD       1         TO STAT-SUB
               MOVE     "WD"       TO PRT-STAT (STAT-SUB).

           IF STR-INS-ITM     = "X" OR "B"
               ADD       1         TO STAT-SUB
               MOVE     "IN"       TO PRT-STAT (STAT-SUB).

           IF STR-ORD-ENG     = "X"
               ADD       1         TO STAT-SUB
               MOVE     "OE"       TO PRT-STAT (STAT-SUB).

           IF STR-OUT-REP     = "X"
               ADD       1         TO STAT-SUB
               MOVE     "OR"       TO PRT-STAT (STAT-SUB).

           IF STR-MAINT       = "X"
               ADD       1         TO STAT-SUB
               MOVE     "MR"       TO PRT-STAT (STAT-SUB).

           IF STR-IMPORT-IND  = "X"
               ADD       1         TO STAT-SUB
               MOVE     "IM"       TO PRT-STAT (STAT-SUB).

      **************************************************************
      **   THE KSAM FILE "USAGEFIL" IS USED TO GET MONTHLY USAGE  **
      **   DATA FOR THE INQUIRY.  IF ERR STAT IS 9, KSAM SUPPLIES **
      **   A FORMATTED ERROR MESSAGE.                             **
      **************************************************************

           MOVE SRT-CORP-CODE  TO CORPCDE OF USAGEFIL-REC-I.
           READ USAGEFIL-I INTO USAGE-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY  "NO MATERIAL STATUS INFO " KEY-VALUE
               MOVE ZEROS TO PRT-MTD, PRT-24H
               GO TO 8-10-HDR-INFO-EXIT.

           MOVE K-MTH-USAGE (13) TO PRT-MTD.
           MOVE K-MTH-USAGE (14) TO PRT-24H.

       HDR-10-13-INFO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       8-10-HDR-INFO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       8-15-HEADINGS.

       8-15-HEADINGS1-6.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM HEADING-1 BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM HEADING-2 BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           IF MTLS-SORT-OPT > SPACES AND MTLS-SORT-OPT NOT = "01"
             MOVE CNTL-BREAK-HOLD-FIELD TO PRT-H2B-VALUE
             WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM HEADING-2B BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINE
             ADD   1                   TO   LINE-COUNT.

      *    MOVE HDR-1                  TO   PRINT-LINE.
      *    WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-RCD.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           ADD 3                       TO   LINE-COUNT.

       8-15-HEADINGS1-6-X.
           EXIT.

       8-15-HEADINGS-CONT.
           MOVE HDR-7                  TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           MOVE HDR-8                  TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           MOVE HDR-9                  TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           MOVE HDR-9A                 TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           MOVE HDR-9B                 TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           MOVE HDR-10                 TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           MOVE HDR-11                 TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           MOVE HDR-12                 TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           MOVE HDR-13                 TO   PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           ADD 12                      TO   LINE-COUNT.

       8-15-HEADINGS-X.
           EXIT.

       8-2-EOJ.
           IF PAPER-IS-132-COLS
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM NORMAL-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0.
           CLOSE MSTORERM-I, MPLTINFO-I, DDESC-I, DPORECD-I,
                DPOITEM-I, DVENDOR-I, USAGEFIL-I, DMANPART-I.
           CLOSE ONLINE-PRT.

       8-3-RETURN.
           RETURN SORT-FILE
      *        AT END MOVE SPACES TO SORT-REC
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO EOSF-SW.
      *          MOVE "Y" TO EOSF-SW.
           IF EOSF-SW NOT = "Y"
               MOVE SRT-CORP-CODE TO PRT-CODE, CODE-ARG.

       8-3-RETURN-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       8-6-MAIN.
           IF LINE-COUNT > 55
               MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE
               WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING NEWPAGE
               MOVE ZEROES TO LINE-COUNT
               ADD 1       TO PG-CTR
               MOVE PG-CTR TO PRT-PAGE
               PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS1-6 THRU 8-15-HEADINGS1-6-X.

           MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 2 LINES.
           ADD 2       TO LINE-COUNT.
      *    MOVE SRT-CORP-CODE TO SAVE-CC.
           ADD 1 TO RET-SORT-K.
           MOVE "N" TO VEN-HDR-SW.
           IF LINE-COUNT > 45
               MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE
               WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING NEWPAGE
               MOVE ZEROES TO LINE-COUNT
               ADD 1       TO PG-CTR
               MOVE PG-CTR TO PRT-PAGE
               PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS1-6 THRU 8-15-HEADINGS1-6-X
               PERFORM HDR-8-9-INFO THRU HDR-10-13-INFO-EXIT
               PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS-CONT THRU  8-15-HEADINGS-X
           ELSE
               PERFORM HDR-8-9-INFO THRU HDR-10-13-INFO-EXIT
               PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS-CONT THRU  8-15-HEADINGS-X.

           IF SONORDER-TOTAL-ONORDER = 0
               PERFORM 8-60-NO-PO-ROUTINE
           ELSE
               PERFORM 8-61-PO-ROUTINE.

      *    IF SORT-CODE = SAVE-CC
      *        IF SORT-PO-NO = SPACES
      *            PERFORM 8-60-NO-PO-ROUTINE
      *        ELSE
      *            PERFORM 8-61-PO-ROUTINE
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE
      *        WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 2 LINES
      *        ADD 2       TO LINE-COUNT
      *        MOVE SORT-CODE TO SAVE-CC
      *        ADD 1 TO RET-SORT-K
      *        MOVE "N" TO VEN-HDR-SW
      *        IF LINE-COUNT > 45
      *            MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-LINE
      *            WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING NEWPAGE
      *            MOVE ZEROES TO LINE-COUNT
      *            ADD 1       TO PG-CTR
      *            MOVE PG-CTR TO PRT-PAGE
      *            PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS1-6 THRU 8-15-HEADINGS1-6-X
      *            PERFORM HDR-8-9-INFO THRU HDR-10-13-INFO-EXIT
      *            PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS-CONT THRU  8-15-HEADINGS-X
      *            IF SORT-PO-NO = SPACES
      *                PERFORM 8-60-NO-PO-ROUTINE
      *            ELSE
      *                PERFORM 8-61-PO-ROUTINE
      *        ELSE
      *            PERFORM HDR-8-9-INFO THRU HDR-10-13-INFO-EXIT
      *            PERFORM 8-15-HEADINGS-CONT THRU  8-15-HEADINGS-X
      *            IF SORT-PO-NO = SPACES
      *                PERFORM 8-60-NO-PO-ROUTINE
      *            ELSE
      *                PERFORM 8-61-PO-ROUTINE.

           PERFORM 8-3-RETURN THRU 8-3-RETURN-EXIT.

      *--------- PRINT CONTROL BREAKS.
           IF MTLS-SORT-OPT NOT = "01" AND MTLS-SORT-OPT NOT = "  "
               IF EOSF-SW NOT = "Y"
                   PERFORM 9-CHECK-CONTROL-BREAK
               END-IF
               IF EOSF-SW = "Y" OR CNTL-BREAK-SW = "Y"
                   PERFORM 9-PRINT-CONTROL-BREAK
                   WRITE PRINT-RCD FROM CONTROL-BREAK-LINE
                                             AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES
                   PERFORM 9-MOVE-CONTROL-BREAK
                   IF EOSF-SW = "N"
                       MOVE 60            TO  LINE-COUNT.

       8-60-NO-PO-ROUTINE.
           MOVE "NO OPEN PURCHASE ORDERS" TO PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1 TO LINE-COUNT.

       8-61-PO-ROUTINE.
           PERFORM 8-62-CHECK-VEN-HDR-SW.
           PERFORM 8-65-FIND-VEND-CODE THRU 8-65-FVC-X.
      *    PERFORM 8-63-MOVE-TO-PRINT.

       8-62-CHECK-VEN-HDR-SW.
           IF VEN-HDR-SW = "N"
               MOVE PO-VEN-HDR TO PRINT-LINE
               WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES
               ADD 1 TO LINE-COUNT
               MOVE "Y" TO VEN-HDR-SW.

       8-63-MOVE-TO-PRINT.
      *    MOVE SORT-PO-NO         TO  PRT-PO.
      *    MOVE SORT-PO-DATE       TO  PRT-PO-D.
      *    MOVE SORT-SHIP-DATE     TO  PRT-SHIP-D.
      *    MOVE SORT-EXP-DATE      TO  PRT-EXP-D.
      *    MOVE SORT-ITM-DLVR      TO  PRT-QTY-DLVR.
      *    MOVE SORT-ITM-ORD       TO  PRT-QTY-ORD.
      *    MOVE SORT-VEND-CODE     TO  PRT-VCODE.
      *    MOVE SORT-ITM-NO        TO  PRT-ITM-NO.
      *    MOVE SORT-UM            TO  PRT-ORD-UM.
           PERFORM 8-64-FIND-VEND-INFO THRU 8-64-FVI-EXIT.
           MOVE PRT-PO-VEN-HDR     TO  PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING 1 LINES.
           ADD 1                   TO  LINE-COUNT.

       8-64-FIND-VEND-INFO.
           MOVE PO-VEN-CODE            TO VEN-ARG, PRT-VCODE.
           MOVE VEN-ARG TO VENCDE OF DVENDOR-REC-I.
           MOVE "00"    TO VENITMNO OF DVENDOR-REC-I.
           READ DVENDOR-I INTO BUF-DVENDOR
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE "NO NAME ON FILE" TO PRT-VNAME
               GO TO 8-64-FVI-EXIT.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBFIND ERR: 8-64-FIND-VEND-INFO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE VEN-NAME TO PRT-VNAME.

       8-64-FVI-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       8-65-FIND-VEND-CODE.
           MOVE CORP-CODE TO CORPCDE OF DPOITEM-REC-I.
           START DPOITEM-I KEY = CORPCDE OF DPOITEM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *           MOVE SPACES    TO SORT-RCD
      *           MOVE CORP-CODE TO SORT-CODE
      *           MOVE "Y" TO SORT-ONORDER-ERROR
      *           RELEASE SORT-RCD
      *           MOVE SPACES TO SORT-ONORDER-ERROR
                  GO TO 8-65-FVC-X
               ELSE
              MOVE "DBFIND ERR: 8-65-FIND-VEND-CODE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       8-651-FVC-CONT.
           READ DPOITEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                  GO TO 8-65-FVC-X
               ELSE
                  MOVE "DBGET ERR: 8-651-FVC-CONT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                  PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
           IF CORPCDE OF DPOITEM-REC-I NOT = SRT-CORP-CODE
               GO TO 8-65-FVC-X.

           MOVE ITM-PO-RCV-NO TO PO-RLSE-RS.

           IF ITM-QTY-DLVR < ITM-QTY-ORD
      *        MOVE SPACES       TO SORT-RCD
               MOVE ITM-QTY-DLVR TO PRT-QTY-DLVR
               MOVE ITM-QTY-ORD  TO PRT-QTY-ORD
               MOVE ITM-UM       TO PRT-ORD-UM
               MOVE ITM-NUMBER   TO PRT-ITM-NO
               MOVE WS-PO        TO PRT-PO-NO
               IF WS-RLSE = ZEROES
                   MOVE SPACES TO PRT-PO-REM
               ELSE
                   MOVE "-" TO PRT-DASH
                   MOVE WS-RLSE TO PRT-RLSE
           ELSE
               GO TO 8-651-FVC-CONT.

       8-652-FVC-CONT.
           MOVE PO-RLSE-RS TO PO-ARG.
           MOVE PO-ARG     TO PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC-I.
           READ DPORECD-I INTO BUF-DPORECD
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               GO TO 8-651-FVC-CONT
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "DBFIND ERR: 8-652-FVC-CONT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.


           MOVE PO-VEN-CODE       TO  PRT-VCODE.

           IF PO-DATE-CN > SPACES
               MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
               MOVE PO-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
               CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
               MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO PRT-PO-D
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES        TO  PRT-PO-D.

           IF PO-SHIP-DATE-CN > SPACES
               IF PO-SHIP-DATE-CN IS NOT NUMERIC
                   MOVE PO-SHIP-DATE TO PRT-SHIP-D
               ELSE
               MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
               MOVE PO-SHIP-DATE TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
               CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
               MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT TO  PRT-SHIP-D
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES         TO  PRT-SHIP-D.

           IF PO-EXPECT-DATE-CN > SPACES
               MOVE 4 TO DATE-MODE
               MOVE PO-EXPECT-DATE  TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN
               CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA
               MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT  TO  PRT-EXP-D
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES          TO  PRT-EXP-D.

           PERFORM 8-63-MOVE-TO-PRINT.

           GO TO 8-651-FVC-CONT.

       8-65-FVC-X.
           EXIT.

       8-WR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       9-UTILITY SECTION.

       COPY MTLSUTIL  IN COPYLIB.

       COPY OVRPFCALL IN COPYLIB.

      *------- DUMMY PARAGRAPH; NOT USED IN THIS PROGRAM.
       9-COMPUTE-USAGE.
           EXIT.
